OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUber launches UK's first robotaxis
OL,4,Awith a driver - here's what it's like
OL,5,Ato ride in one
OL,6,
OL,7,FLondoners are able to hail the UK's
OL,8,Ffirst robotaxis - as Uber today becomes
OL,9,Fthe first company to launch a
OL,10,Fself-driving minicab.
OL,12,FInitially, it only has 15 autonomous
OL,13,Fvehicles with a licence to operate in
OL,14,Fthe city, and each one must have a
OL,15,Fhuman safety driver behind the wheel
OL,16,Fready to take control if anything goes
OL,17,Fwrong.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
